menu "Kurisu Pro Audio Configuration"

    config AUDIO_MIC_SHIFT_16
        bool "INMP441 Microphone 16-bit shift (Clean, Zero Clipping)"
        default y
        help
            Selects MSB 16 bits of INMP441 24-bit PCM data in 32-bit slot (shift by 16).
            Prevents digital saturation clipping while maintaining clear voice capture.

    config AUDIO_MIC_SHIFT_12
        bool "INMP441 Microphone 12-bit shift (+24dB High Sensitivity)"
        default n
        help
            Selects 12-bit shift for high sensitivity. Warning: loud speech may cause clipping.

endmenu
